 "_note_delivery2": "Added 19.11.2026 for delivery 2 (TZ v4, amendment 3). Nothing above was changed; keys were added. valid/: every journal names its folder of source documents (docs, a path under inputs/) and what J2 and J3 must find (J3: records accepted, quotes checked). The documents of the five journals received earlier were taken from their genesis containers by the kernel. Two new journals: baicalin-n3-shard1.wal (a real run of sbgk 0.2.2, 7950a811..., three open-access papers) and kinds-batch-put.wal (written by the kernel for the vectors: every record kind, a batch with a submit and a new document version, a failed line). corrupt/: entries with level J2 or J3 are new; their docs name the folder to check them with; delivery1 is what delivery 1 (0.1.3) answers. boundary/: docs and delivery2, the outcome levels J0-J3 must give now. kernel: sbgk audit-verify of sbgk 0.2.2 (7950a811...).",
